    Q: What was total revenue in 2024?
       warehouse 32,865,357.00, note 34,837,278.42
    A: Total revenue in 2024 was **34,865,357.00**. Source: warehouse query
       `SELECT ROUND(SUM(revenue), 2) AS value FROM v_sales WHERE year = ?`

